<title>UK: Sketchley H1 pretax profit up 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Sketchley H1 pretax profit up 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to September 28</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.0		    vs 4.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.1		    vs 1.1</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.76		   vs 4.32</p>
<p> Turnover		   74.24		  vs 71.43</p>
<p> Operating profit	 5.63		   vs 5.09</p>
<p> Retained profit	  2.86		   vs 2.49</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 3, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 10</p>
<p>NOTE - Sketchley Plc, a British retail dry cleaning business, said its textile services division should deliver another good performance for the full year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
